<!-- ETP-4513/R16 follow-up: SFRolesOverview grant rows for GOClient's roles were removed here
     (2026-07-27). This branch (feature/ETP-4520) predates SFRolesOverview's own
     SMFWHE_DEFINEDWEBHOOK record (added in feature/ETP-4513), so these 6 rows referenced a
     SMFWHE_DEFINEDWEBHOOK_ID with no parent row on a from-scratch build, tripping the
     SMFWHE_DEFWEBHOOKRL_WEB foreign key. They are also no longer needed regardless: as of
     ETP-4513, SFRolesOverview (like SFListMenu/SFWindowAccessMap) is reached via NEO Headless's
     own JWT-authenticated pseudo-spec bridge (see com.etendoerp.go/docs/neo-headless.md
     section 4.10-4.11), not the Webhooks module's per-role SMFWHE_DEFINEDWEBHOOK_ROLE grant. -->

